@startuml
title USEI09 – Proximity Search (Nearest-N with Filters)

actor Analyst as A
participant "System Controller" as SC
participant "ProximitySearchService" as PS
participant "2DTree" as T

A -> SC : 1. Request nearest N stations(lat, lon, N, filter)
activate SC

SC -> SC : 2. Validate parameters (lat, lon, N, filter)

SC -> PS : 3. findNearestStations(lat, lon, N, filter)
activate PS

PS -> T : 4. searchNearest(lat, lon, N)
activate T
T --> PS : 5. Return nearest station nodes (unordered)
deactivate T

PS -> PS : 6. Apply filterByTimeZone(stations, filter)
PS --> SC : 7. Return candidate stations
deactivate PS

SC -> SC : 8. Compute Haversine distances\nand sort by distance ASC

SC --> A : 9. Return list of N nearest stations
deactivate SC

A -> A : 10. Display results (station, distance, timezone)

@enduml